    Header 2|Welcome
    Text
      Text:
        Welcome to the Features Demo. We know it is not much to look at. That is on purpose. We didn't want to
        distract you with glossy pixels and fancy gradients like an Instagram influencer showing off lunch.

        This demo shows how features work, one at a time, without burying you in the multiple features of a real app.
        When you finish here, check the Tutorial demo for step by step guidance, or the other demos to see how
        parts work together.
        
        Want pretty? Sure, you can even make things pretty with Bootstrap or other templates.
    Header 3|Towel packed? Good. The Guide approves
    Text Click on a link on the left sidebar to get started.
